        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack On Ghost</strong> is a pixel art tower defense game where you battle supernatural forces using strategy, magic, and smart resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade unique elemental towers, gather valuable resources with your collector unit, and hold the line against relentless ghostly waves. Every choice matters — will your defense hold?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941950/extras/debc4b9037242b05ef9906d3dd803db4.poster.avif?t=1759155440\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941950/extras/debc4b9037242b05ef9906d3dd803db4.webm?t=1759155440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941950/extras/debc4b9037242b05ef9906d3dd803db4.mp4?t=1759155440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 Gather resources to expand your defenses<br>🧙 Build and upgrade magical towers with unique effects<br>👻 Defend against waves of spectral enemies<br>🔥 Plan, survive, and adapt your strategy each round<br>🎨 Enjoy charming handcrafted pixel visuals</p>",
